# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC (github.com/jmoon312/acct2102 — it serves the
# GitHub Pages activities and study guides). Nothing below may ever be
# committed. These files currently live here untracked, which means a single
# `git add -A` would publish them, so they are named explicitly.
# Add named files to commits — never `git add -A` / `git add .` in this repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

